{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297927","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297927","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1029792701:1":{"text":"보고서 봤어요. 이렇게 빠를 줄은 몰랐어요!","source_cn":"我看过了报告，没想到你们进度有这么快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8218444BD38CD09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029792702:1":{"text":"이번에는 미스릴 상회의 지원을 받았는데, 전반적인 운영에 어려운 점은 없었나요?","source_cn":"这次有秘银商会支持，整体运营上有什么困难吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31538FC481974F20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029792703:1":{"text":"생산이나 판매는 문제없어. 주문 처리 쪽은 깊은바위 마을 사람들이 나보다 더 능숙하더라고.","source_cn":"生产和销售那些没问题，做订单嘛，深岩村的人干这个比我熟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCB59BFA21D3FC05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029792704:1":{"text":"하지만 다른 지역과 비교하면 여긴 여전히 여행객들을 맞이하기에 조금 부족해.","source_cn":"只不过和别的地方比，这里不太适合迎接游客。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FBFA8E38AB5674A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029792705:1":{"text":"아무리 둘러봐도 풀이랑 돌밖에 없잖아. 있는 거라곤 마을과 공방, 광산뿐인데 전부 주문을 처리하느라 쉴 틈 없이 돌아가고 있어.","source_cn":"看来看去，除了那些草啊石头啊，就只有工坊、村子和矿洞，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A38AFBB1616C405","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029792706:1":{"text":"여행객들이 흥미를 가져도 딱히 보여줄 게 없달까?","source_cn":"就算游客有兴趣参观，也没地方给他们看啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F833B6D2198DAA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029792707:1":{"text":"그렇네요... 전에 했던 무기 제작 체험 같은 것도 여행객 입장에서는 충분하지 않을 거예요.","source_cn":"确实……之前那种亲手尝试生产武器的工坊体验，好像也没法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3595DF4E0C6BF6D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029792708:1":{"text":"가장 중요한 건 마을에 여행객들이 묵을 숙소마저 없다는 거야.","source_cn":"最重要的是，村子里好像也没有适合招待客人的旅店啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9A175B8A84789CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029792709:1":{"text":"깊은바위 마을의 발전을 위해서 방향 전환을 진지하게 고민해봐야 할지도 모르겠어...","source_cn":"看起来深岩村要想发展，还得考虑考虑转型……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x833302EEC8097AA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊芙":{"text":"이브","source":"伊芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}